+# Frozen qualification workload
+
+Source base fa2363c24bf921ecf0bd8390739e96041e620e8f; approved parent #540.
+Worker #547 must measure the exact installed candidate, with no PYTHONPATH source
+shadowing. Package/source member equality and interpreter identity are separate
+checks from behavior. No production symlink change or enablement.
+
+Use a disposable tmux socket with100windows/panes and a local metadata-only native
+protocol fixture. The fixture sends ordinary transitions for ten concurrently
+active conversations, each once per5seconds with staggered timing, yielding
+2status changes/second. Idle and ordinary active measurement windows each60seconds
+after separately measured startup. Include event bursts, gaps, reconnect and PID
+replacement as distinct qualification cases. Record the fixture limitation: no
+provider/model requests, so a passing fixture cannot prove real native broadcasts.
+
+Count observer Python owner and every owned control client/helper in aggregate
+RSS and CPU; exclude disposable workload pane processes and the native fixture
+server, but list their costs separately. CPU denominator is one core, not machine
+capacity:100*delta_user_system_seconds/window_wall_seconds. Capture monotonic time
+and /proc process birth identities. Include exited child usage or explain any
+measurement gap. Thresholds idle<=1%, active<=5%, RSS<=256MiB; report startup
+separately and p95 from event receipt to public projected inventory<=2seconds.
+Do not widen thresholds or silently report fewer tabs. A failed threshold remains
+a failed receipt; diagnose and repair within existing tickets before acceptance.
+
+Existing-host qualification: read-only existing session/window metadata and
+qualified passive native feeds only. No new turns, prompt injection, agent
+restart, active TUI health requests, terminal content capture, pane/window/session
+layout mutations, theme writes, monitor activation or shared-service restart.
+Use only bounded observer processes owned by this packet and verify cleanup
+with a fresh OS resource readback. Baseline 44tabs is historical, measure exact
+current count. Never place raw titles, endpoint tokens, private paths or terminal
+content in committed evidence; record counts and curated protocol capability.
+
+A missing real status transition during read-only live qualification is a named
+unverified live capability, not a fabricated pass. Resolve through passive wait
+within bounded budget, or retain explicit qualification limits and ask root to
+adjudicate ticket closure without claiming full acceptance.
