+A preliminary persistent-control-client probe was discarded before product implementation: tmux emits a separate control frame for each queued command, raw hostile option output can resemble protocol framing and straightforward doublequote escaping did not exactly roundtrip dollar/carriage-return values. The owned prototype client/server exited and were reaped. The simpler native redraw repair avoids these protocol risks. Primary owner retains memory disposition at substantivecloseout.
